Arcade game architecture guidance:
- Use an HTML5 <canvas> sized dynamically or fixed at 800x600 with CSS scaling.
- Structure: Player entity, Enemy/Obstacle array, Bullet/Particle array, Score, Lives, Level.
- Simple AABB (Axis-Aligned Bounding Box) or circular distance collision detection.
- Web Audio API oscillator for sound FX (beep on hit, explosion noise).
